    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <div class="callout">
      <p>
        This website sets no cookies. It does not use local storage, tracking pixels, analytics, or any other technique that stores or reads information on your device.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is why you will not find a cookie banner here. There is nothing to consent to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the GDPR you can ask me to give you a copy of the data I hold about you, correct it if it is wrong, delete it, restrict what I do with it, or provide it in a portable form. You can object to processing based on legitimate interest. Write to <a href="mailto:alexander@symbiosisleadership.com">alexander@symbiosisleadership.com</a> and I will respond within one month.
    </p>
    <p>
      There is no automated decision-making and no profiling. Decisions about cohort places are made by me, in conversation with you.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you think I have handled your data badly, I would rather hear it from you first. You also have the right to complain to the Swedish supervisory authority, Integritetsskyddsmyndigheten (IMY), at <a href="https://www.imy.se">imy.se</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
    <p>
      If what I do with personal data changes, I will update this page and the date at the top.
    </p>

